body:

Derived from Gewenxin Yu's 2024 essay [Exploring the Analogia Entis Principle in Electroacoustic Music (with Intelligible Sound)](https://transcendental-electroacoustic.xyz/posts/analogia-entis.html), this project explores further intersections of electroacoustic music and sonification.

